<title>FRANCE: Fire forces Eurodisney hotel evacuation.</title>
<headline>Fire forces Eurodisney hotel evacuation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fire at the Eurodisney leisure complex east of Paris forced the evacuation of hundreds of hotel guests on Saturday, Disney officials said.</p>
<p>Firemen brought the blaze under control after three hours. There were no casualties, but damage was extensive, the officials added.</p>
<p>They could not say what caused the fire at the Sequoia Lodge, one of several hotels in the sprawling complex east of the French capital.</p>
